  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "319期封面作品- 風雨中ê弄險 "
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgNaJQ9MYijb68GfcDifHFTPz8ipMpIEIRwdWCr93tDWoA3WY761ra8H_3Ej6m2uyDg9Ri1vyVz0z9B9IF4OQAM7qEFLdzJGhGzQddYvzSa1hRX6LnVjqjHhsa5OtHJFAHybtzrhZkg3jr9/s2048/%25E5%25A9%2586.tif\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1603\" data-original-width=\"2048\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgNaJQ9MYijb68GfcDifHFTPz8ipMpIEIRwdWCr93tDWoA3WY761ra8H_3Ej6m2uyDg9Ri1vyVz0z9B9IF4OQAM7qEFLdzJGhGzQddYvzSa1hRX6LnVjqjHhsa5OtHJFAHybtzrhZkg3jr9/w640-h500/%25E5%25A9%2586.tif\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><p></p><p><br /></p><p><b>作品名稱</b></p><p>風雨中ê弄險&nbsp;</p><p><br /></p><p><b>作品簡介</b></p><p>夾腳拖劇團舞台劇《足久足久以前，有一个尪婆》製作做繪本ê封面圖，主角阿廣ê弄險旅程tī狂風暴雨--裡展開。</p><p><br /></p><p><b>創作方式</b></p><p>使用電腦畫圖軟體處理</p><p><br /></p><p><b>年份</b></p><p>2020年</p><p><br /></p><p><b>作者簡介</b></p><p>錢君銜。文化大學藝術研究所美術組出業 ， 專業口技表演者，mā是『喜劇幽默大賽』、『達人秀』得獎者；真gâu結合口技kap趣味ê肢體短劇，是跨類別ê表演藝術工作者。有成立「大錢口技實驗室」，影視作品包含《家和萬事興》、《田庄英雄》、《萬事OK團》主持等等；tsit幾年有投入夾腳拖劇團ê「台語故事劇場」、「故事雜菜羹」tàu推廣台語。</p><p><br /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjqIo9zrjXUdzzRHIPJnPsZpgEIv6B4n9FPz5zd1WL2pKgzMPDDK6sszd5mVNg4dN0KUF5J7p3om3Eys7DXpWFZu8pGQgVqE3c01oGD27bqPuP9vm_YgqE7O-oIG_br1D3cS0YpL39UtuVW/s1424/319%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjqIo9zrjXUdzzRHIPJnPsZpgEIv6B4n9FPz5zd1WL2pKgzMPDDK6sszd5mVNg4dN0KUF5J7p3om3Eys7DXpWFZu8pGQgVqE3c01oGD27bqPuP9vm_YgqE7O-oIG_br1D3cS0YpL39UtuVW/s320/319%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" /></a></div><br /><p><br /></p><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><b><br /></b></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><b>歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　</b></span></div><div><b><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></b></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><b>線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></b></span></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><b>線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"asy